From 3f81005c522731b736a48924095a834849600318 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Date: Tue, 8 Sep 2026 12:39:40 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(deploy): copiar backend/lib al contenedor
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

El servidor requiere ./lib/llm en el arranque (simple-server.js:8), pero
ninguno de los dos Dockerfile copiaba backend/lib. El contenedor moría con
MODULE_NOT_FOUND antes de escuchar, dejando la API en 502 y sin aplicar las
migraciones 002-015.
---
 Dockerfile         | 1 +
 backend/Dockerfile | 1 +
 2 files changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/Dockerfile b/Dockerfile
index 61386ae..8b058f0 100644
--- a/Dockerfile
+++ b/Dockerfile
@@ -7,6 +7,7 @@ RUN npm install --omit=dev --no-audit --no-fund
 
 # Código + migraciones + datos de seed
 COPY backend/simple-server.js ./simple-server.js
+COPY backend/lib ./lib
 COPY backend/db ./db
 COPY backend/scripts ./scripts
 
diff --git a/backend/Dockerfile b/backend/Dockerfile
index f88bcb2..9ee2328 100644
--- a/backend/Dockerfile
+++ b/backend/Dockerfile
@@ -5,6 +5,7 @@ COPY package.json package-lock.json* ./
 RUN npm install --omit=dev --no-audit --no-fund
 
 COPY simple-server.js ./simple-server.js
+COPY lib ./lib
 COPY db ./db
 COPY scripts ./scripts
 
-- 
2.43.0

